# What not to upload when deploying from the CLI (`vercel --prod`).
# Vercel builds from source, so build output and local-only assets never need to go up —
# and two files here exceed Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit, which fails the deploy outright:
#   media-src/*.mp4                  source footage for scripts/build-brand-film.mts (132 MB)
#   .next/dev/cache/turbopack/*.sst  local Turbopack dev cache (119 MB)
.next
media-src
node_modules
test-results
playwright-report
.git
